---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 24
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: Who may use the settings of Paperless Sync
    accDescr: An administrator of Nextcloud reaches the settings page of Paperless Sync and the rest of the administration, and delegates the page to a group under Administration privileges. A member of that group reaches the page and its routes, with their own password, and neither the rest of the administration nor the keys of the app configuration through the provisioning API of Nextcloud: Nextcloud answers 403. So a setting reaches the app configuration only through the routes of the page, which check every value. Every other user gets 403 on every route of the page.

    admin(["Administrator<br>of Nextcloud"])
    member(["Member of the<br>delegated group"])
    other(["Every other user"])
    subgraph nextcloud ["Nextcloud server"]
        rest["The rest of the<br>administration"]
        page["The settings page of<br>Paperless Sync and its routes:<br>every value is checked"]
        config[("App configuration")]
    end

    admin --> rest
    admin -- "delegates the page<br>under Administration privileges" --> page
    member -- "with their<br>own password" --> page
    member -. "403" .-> rest
    member -. "403 through the<br>provisioning API" .-> config
    other -. "403" .-> page
    page --> config

    classDef nextcloud fill:#0082c92e,stroke:#0082c9,stroke-width:2px
    classDef delegated fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    class rest,page,config nextcloud
    class member delegated
